        {
          "text": "Kwoŋbedo go jabanirok, twodo lapoŋ i cinge kodi i cunye to won tiŋere malo. Go lareyo woko ji kweth ma k'ogwoko jo, aka lapiemo kiri gi Kere maloyo. T'ilaturo go ki gi cingi dhano. ",
