              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menyirok ma wor kodi odikin m'owaci rin me obedo adieri, riameno iripo kano nyaliŋliŋ kwoŋbedo latero ndelo kweth mafodi k'otundo i kare.”",
          "type": "text",
